sequenceDiagram
    participant DeploySH as deploy.sh<br/>Init Container
    participant K8sAPI as OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as rhods-operator
    participant Manifests as odh-manifests.tar.gz
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP
    participant BB as Blackbox Exporter<br/>9114/TCP
    participant AM as Alertmanager<br/>443/TCP
    participant Dashboard as odh-dashboard<br/>8443/TCP
    participant NBC as odh-notebook-controller<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ModelCtrl as odh-model-controller<br/>8080/TCP
    participant MMesh as modelmesh-controller<br/>8080/TCP
    participant DSPO as data-science-pipelines-operator<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ClusterProm as cluster Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP
    participant PD as PagerDuty API<br/>443/TCP
    participant DMS as Dead Man's Snitch<br/>443/TCP
    participant SMTP as SMTP Server

    Note over DeploySH,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Component Deployment

    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Create namespaces<br/>SA Token Auth, TLS 1.2+
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply CRDs (OdhApplication,<br/>OdhDocument, OdhQuickStart,<br/>OdhDashboardConfig)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply ISV tiles &<br/>Dashboard configs
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Apply NetworkPolicies<br/>(operator, apps, monitoring)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Create KfDef CRs<br/>(dashboard, nbc, modelmesh, dspo, notebooks, monitoring, anaconda)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch notification:<br/>KfDef CRs created
    Operator->>Manifests: Extract component manifests
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply component resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, etc.)
    DeploySH->>K8sAPI: Deploy monitoring stack<br/>(Prometheus, Alertmanager,<br/>Blackbox Exporter)

    Note over Prom,SMTP: Flow 2: Monitoring Pipeline (Managed Service)

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of Prom: Init containers poll<br/>until services ready<br/>(up to ~38min timeout)
        Prom->>Dashboard: Wait for health<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
        Prom->>NBC: Wait for health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
        Prom->>ModelCtrl: Wait for health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
        Prom->>MMesh: Wait for health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
        Prom->>DSPO: Wait for health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    end

    loop Every scrape interval
        Prom->>NBC: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
        Prom->>ModelCtrl: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
        Prom->>MMesh: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
        Prom->>DSPO: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
    end

    Prom->>ClusterProm: Federate metrics<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS, TLS (service CA)<br/>Bearer Token (SA)

    loop Health probes
        BB->>Dashboard: Probe health<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS, Bearer Token
        BB->>NBC: Probe health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, Bearer Token
    end

    Note over AM,SMTP: Alert Routing (Managed Service)

    AM->>PD: Critical alerts<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, TLS 1.2+<br/>Service Key Auth
    AM->>DMS: Heartbeat (Watchdog)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, TLS 1.2+<br/>URL Secret
    AM->>SMTP: User notifications<br/>(PVC usage warnings)<br/>STARTTLS, Username/Password
